# The robot's position in words, from the places file and AMCL.
---
# True only when AMCL is sure (not when roughly: that can be a metre off) and there is
# a map -> base_footprint transform
bool localized
# How sure AMCL is: sure, roughly, lost, or unknown (no AMCL pose yet)
string certainty
# A sentence for speaking, e.g. "I'm in the kitchen, near the fridge, facing the sofa."
string description
string room
# Nearest place within the brain's near_distance, or empty
string nearest_place
float64 nearest_distance
# Place the robot is roughly facing, or empty
string facing_place
float64 x
float64 y
float64 yaw
